# Build configuration for `vite build --mode e2e-pwa`, the end-to-end build that
# keeps its service worker. Same in-memory adapters as `.env.e2e`, same reserved
# `demo-*` project that cannot exist, and committed for the same reason: it holds
# no credentials and points at nothing real.
#
# The value has to match `.env.e2e`, because both builds render the same login
# screen and the same account page from it. `tests/unit/pwaConfig.test.ts` holds
# the two files to each other rather than leaving it to whoever edits one.
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=demo-goitei
